        "PMC10908794::web::037::microstructure_investigation",
        "PMC7515071::web::011::3_2_wear_investigations"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The improvement in wear resistance will arise from formation of a stable, adherent protective oxide layer.",
